// An identifier is a lowercase word continued by lowercase letters, `_`, or `-` before a lowercase letter; a following integer and primes are a variable's decoration.
Fact person Identified by Alice, Bob
Fact neighbour-of Identified by person1 * person2.
+neighbour-of(Alice, Bob).
?neighbour-of(Alice, Bob).
?(Exists person', person'': neighbour-of(person', person'')).
